    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like a rot. every breath i take feels like a theft from the men who should be breathing instead of me. i can't carry this shame back to the capital. i can't let them see me like this... a hollow shell of a leader. what is left for a man who has nothing left to give?",
